This game-book has very simple combat system. There is no strength or stamina, because all your heroes are just kids, and it might be fruitless for them to strive for progress by force. But there is luck that invisibly influences everyone's life.
To try luck You just have to roll dice (single cube) and write down a derived number. That would be Your luck that won't change along the game. If You face situations when it's imperative to try luck, follow the instructions.
Keep in mind that success of the adventure depends on Your actions, but not on rolling dice. Generally, the necessity of trying Your luck appears only in distress, when only a miracle can save You. So make thorough preparations for the adventure.
In addition, write down names of Your companion characters and items to the traveler leaflet. Do remember that all characters have strong and weak points.

Enjoy the game!